OL,3,GNEWSACare home pledges to improve after
OL,4,Apatient's choking death
OL,5,
OL,6,FSally Robinson, assistant coroner for
OL,7,FEssex, has set out her concerns in a
OL,8,Fprevention of future deaths report in
OL,9,Fwhich she said Quelch was not
OL,10,Fconsistently supervised whilst eating
OL,11,Fmeals. The home said it had now
OL,12,Fimproved safety for its residents.
